data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":84,"item_id":"rs_02a874b4a47cb2c2016ac953cec0e88196b135e6a105f021b4","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test adjustments**\n\nI’m thinking about how to best reuse existing tests and if I should add new details within those tasks. Should I restart and adjust variables after the tasks? Maybe it's a good idea to separate the new tests and copy the fixture. Also, I wonder if I could create a test helper to use the same existing test scenario before I detail the snapshot. There's a lot to ponder in making these adjustments!"}

